<title>THAILAND: Thai BBC posts big first-half loss.</title>
<headline>Thai BBC posts big first-half loss.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the six months ending June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>    Share (baht)     loss   0.94	vs    profit   0.90</p>
<p>    Net profit	 loss  970.9	vs    profit  464.2</p>
<p>Note: Revenues not stated. Company's full name is Bangkok Bank of Commerce Plc.</p>
